# JSR packages (the @std/* escape hatch) are distributed through the JSR
# npm-compat registry, not npmjs; pnpm resolves top-level `jsr:` specifiers
# itself, and this scope entry covers the transitive @jsr/* dependencies
# declared inside those packages. Dependency SOURCE only — JSR is not a
# release channel for this repository (ADR-0108).
@jsr:registry=https://npm.jsr.io
